  "stem": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\">In triangle&nbsp;<math alttext=\"upper J upper K upper L\"><mi>J</mi><mi>K</mi><mi>L</mi></math>, the measures of&nbsp;<math alttext=\"angle upper K\"><mo>&#8736;</mo><mi>K</mi></math> and&nbsp;<math alttext=\"angle upper L\"><mo>&#8736;</mo><mi>L</mi></math> are each <math alttext=\"48 degree\"><mrow><mn>48</mn></mrow><mo>&#176;</mo></math>. What is the measure of <math alttext=\"angle upper J\"><mo>&#8736;</mo><mi>J</mi></math>, in degrees? (Disregard the degree symbol when entering your answer.)</p>",
